[28.115725, "o", "\r\n \u001b[48;2;21;21;21m   latency, 5xx rate, latency over time, and latency by region for the last 24 hours. \u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[48;2;21;21;21m   Save it as checkout_latency.json, deploy it as demo_checkout_latency, then check   \u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[48;2;21;21;21m   in Splunk Web that every panel renders.\u001b[7m \u001b[27m                                           \u001b[49m\r\n \u001b[48;2;21;21;21m                                                                                      \u001b[49m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mAuto Balance\u001b[22m                                                          \u001b[35mRun Everything\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[2m~/payments\u001b[22m\r\n"]
